WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:06.902
Six digits, then you're riding, and Telo Ride remembers you for a year.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.478
Type the code, paste it, or take the one your phone offers. Anything that isn't a

00:00:15.478 --> 00:00:18.896
digit drops away, and six digits confirm at once.

00:00:20.647 --> 00:00:25.173
A code that doesn't match clears the field, marks it, and says so out loud. The

00:00:25.173 --> 00:00:26.905
focus goes straight back.

00:00:30.971 --> 00:00:36.042
A code works for ten minutes, once. After five wrong ones, even the right code waits

00:00:36.042 --> 00:00:37.187
for a new one.

00:00:41.295 --> 00:00:45.888
The backend checks only a keyed hash, finds or makes your account, and starts a

00:00:45.888 --> 00:00:48.456
session in a cookie scripts can't read.

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:55.988
Open any screen without a session, and sign-in opens first. Confirm the code, and

00:00:55.988 --> 00:00:58.069
you're back where you were going.

00:01:01.942 --> 00:01:06.675
Each ride moves the session forward a year. If the backend can't be reached, the

00:01:06.675 --> 00:01:08.513
screen opens all the same.

00:01:12.266 --> 00:01:15.679
Phone to desktop, the six cells keep one calm row.

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:27.194
What the tests prove: the right code signs you in, a wrong one is counted, and a

00:01:27.194 --> 00:01:29.738
session lasts a year from its last use.

00:01:32.913 --> 00:01:37.517
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:37.862 --> 00:01:42.373
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:01:42.373 --> 00:01:44.044
every hill and interval.

00:01:44.390 --> 00:01:49.568
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:01:49.568 --> 00:01:55.016
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:01:55.016 --> 00:01:58.006
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:01:58.351 --> 00:02:00.843
A custom workout lives under Profile.
